# Memory Notes for marksportfolio

## Testing
- **IMPORTANT**: Always run tests with `npm test -- --run` or configure to never use watch mode
- Never run tests in watch mode by default
- When running tests, use the `--run` flag to exit after completion
- This prevents tests from hanging or keeping processes open

## Project Configuration
- Using Vitest for testing with React Testing Library
- Test files are colocated with components using `.test.tsx` extension
- All 50 component tests passing as of Feb 5, 2026
